<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Message</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .message-box {
            padding: 30px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="message-box">
        Hello, love
        I miss you so much. I want to hug you tight
        I love you so much!
    </div>
</body>
</html>
